From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: counter: Add a driver for the Allwinner H616 AVS counters

The H616 timer block has two 33-bit audio/video sync counters (AVS_CNT0/1,
H616 user manual v1.0, 3.6.6.14 to 3.6.6.17): free-running counters of OSC24M divided
by a programmable divisor, which can be enabled, paused and loaded with
a start value. The upper 32 bits are visible.

Add a counter subsystem driver for them, with the enable, pause,
prescaler (divisor N, 2..2048) and frequency (rate of the visible count,
24 MHz / 2N) extensions, and the devicetree binding.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---

--- /dev/null
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/counter/allwinner,sun50i-h616-avs-counter.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
+%YAML 1.2
+---
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/counter/allwinner,sun50i-h616-avs-counter.yaml#
+$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+
+title: Allwinner H616 audio/video sync counters
+
+maintainers:
+  - Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
+
+description:
+  Two free-running 33-bit counters in the timer block, clocked by OSC24M
+  through a programmable divisor, used for audio/video synchronisation.
+
+properties:
+  compatible:
+    const: allwinner,sun50i-h616-avs-counter
+
+  reg:
+    maxItems: 1
+
+  clocks:
+    maxItems: 1
+
+required:
+  - compatible
+  - reg
+  - clocks
+
+additionalProperties: false
+
+examples:
+  - |
+    counter@30090c0 {
+        compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-avs-counter";
+        reg = <0x030090c0 0x10>;
+        clocks = <&osc24M>;
+    };
